            "name": "Dell Servers Create an event subscription",
            "description": {
              "content": "Creates a new event subscription that configures the iDRAC to push event notifications to a specified destination URL when events matching the subscription criteria occur. iDRAC supports up to eight concurrent subscriptions.",
